{"event_type":"review","id":"04e8983b230b2016350a8b167c4a3d96331864d060d61598fa3e610ca5c7dc00","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T13:50:32Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/68a357304ddd4a5a95cf565687889f76f7ab0e2c780d0c86e32a333d992ac95a","sha256":"68a357304ddd4a5a95cf565687889f76f7ab0e2c780d0c86e32a333d992ac95a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/7435191c6423a5c5067b4b6c551f0b9b8d236e4aa9e0c7cc44f993dfa7002c28","sha256":"7435191c6423a5c5067b4b6c551f0b9b8d236e4aa9e0c7cc44f993dfa7002c28"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/53a33768ce149bd87e37beb71e4fa300b16367e4092cb4152a6a0597ec287181","sha256":"53a33768ce149bd87e37beb71e4fa300b16367e4092cb4152a6a0597ec287181"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2a396841616d4fc1dd4b7193f54893442b8d4a3765dcdfddbcfabae03eaa2f20","sha256":"2a396841616d4fc1dd4b7193f54893442b8d4a3765dcdfddbcfabae03eaa2f20"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5bda18b29791d2e6271aa50de0baca9f226ad4d57c795041e70197bf43e3f42a","sha256":"5bda18b29791d2e6271aa50de0baca9f226ad4d57c795041e70197bf43e3f42a"}],"attempt_id":"5ddabb860ca5f7624b2e7b9f99c7d762df59507fe2bc219de3800b79d3fa42f9:0:1","base":"dd150256ebc86768505192225f5991dc8c53993b","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"1c3c98bf13a4afee07aef53bb8be159acb866ac6","body":"**Canonicalize the ordinary report path before recording it.**\n\nIf cancellation occurs while `address.ts:896-898` writes or records a report through a symlinked directory, terminal persistence looks up the canonical path instead. The lookup misses, so the exclusive create fails with `EEXIST`. The cancelled report is not written, and the owner can be quarantined.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-import { delimiter, dirname, isAbsolute, join, relative, resolve } from 'node:path';\n+import { basename, delimiter, dirname, isAbsolute, join, relative, resolve } from 'node:path';\n```\n\n```diff\n export async function noteAddressOrdinaryReport(token: object, path: string, bytes: string) {\n   await validateAddressTerminalAuthority(token);\n+  path = resolve(await realpath(dirname(resolve(path))), basename(path));\n   const stat = await lstat(path);\n```\n\n</details>","id":"41d8951493bd1177712c8d2cba3f5a88a3539969976619619059ac64eb0ce8aa","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Canonicalize the ordinary report path before recording it."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"00bd1485d9b41d249d18d9e7f0c2d0ffcab4abf4","body":"**Rotate the history before it reaches the record limit.**\n\n`withLock` reuses the full history across lifetimes (`addressOwnership.ts:1061-1064`). At 64 records, the next active transition fails and calls `lose()`, which can leave a quarantine marker. Later runs then require attended recovery.\n\nA successful lifetime without child claims writes two records, so 32 such lifetimes can exhaust the history. Restore safe rotation after quiescence under the admission mutex, and reserve space for completion before admitting work.","id":"c5af8c47504be12807381b7cf7b4859d37fa6b6bd20018ea05be083ce4cdaefe","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Rotate the history before it reaches the record limit."}],"head":"1ae799af42673035983bed9156474a46e17f1f9b","head_tree":"74119e2e60617e97b4070712a18195b8b48c1179","input_scope":[{"blob":"1c3c98bf13a4afee07aef53bb8be159acb866ac6","intervals":[[1,963]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts"},{"blob":"00bd1485d9b41d249d18d9e7f0c2d0ffcab4abf4","intervals":[[1,1424]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts"}],"